# SCRLOGIN.C: the login screen and the home screen.
# W=18 login labels: LG_VCOL - LG_LCOL - 1
400 MG_USER Enter user name:
401 MG_PASS Enter password:
# MG_DATA's ^1, a directory of up to LINK_MAXDIR, is cut at the frame.
# W=61 login box: LG_LEFT + LG_W - 2 - LG_LCOL
402 MG_DATA Data: ^1
# W=79 key hints: VID_COLS - 1, level digits not counted
403 MG_HINT Enter=Next Esc=Quit F1=Help

404 MG_TOOMANY Too many failed logins
# W=79 key hints: VID_COLS - 1, level digits not counted
405 MG_HOMEHINT F10=Menu Ctrl-F=Search F3=Quit F9=Keys F1=Help
# W=55 home box text: HM_W - 5, from HM_COL to the frame
407 MG_HUSER User              ^1
408 MG_HLEVEL Access level      ^1 (^2)
# W=33 MG_HLEVEL's ^2 within its 55
409 MG_LVL1 read only
410 MG_LVL2 operator
411 MG_LVL3 administrator
# The counts of STATUS, deleted records included.
# W=55 home box text: HM_W - 5, from HM_COL to the frame
412 MG_HITEMS Item records      ^1
413 MG_HLOCS Location records  ^1
414 MG_HCATS Category records  ^1
415 MG_HMENU Press F10 or Alt-letter for the menus, F1 for help.
416 MG_HDATE Today             ^1
417 MG_HEMPTY No items yet: Items > New item adds the first.
418 MG_HOLDDATE This PC's date is before ^1: set it with DATE.

419 MG_RELINKED Connection lost and made again: type the password again
420 MG_GARBLED The line to the server garbles what it carries. Check the cable and that both ends use the same speed, then start again.
